From ffa4d6f80868a7ad6ec0b614d7f84bcf0460ece2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JUstin <justinscollo@protonmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:33:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] bcmdhd-legacy: tolerate unsupported preinit iovars

The ROM's 4.218 firmware boots on the 4329 but lacks several optional
iovars expected by the newer 5.90 host driver.  dhd_dev_init_ioctl
returned -23, so dhd_open failed and WifiHW tore wlan0 down.  Log the
optional failure and continue so cfg80211/supplicant can bring the
interface up.
---
 drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd-legacy/wl_android.c | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd-legacy/wl_android.c b/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd-legacy/wl_android.c
index 27b96d38..c76e6a2a 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd-legacy/wl_android.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/bcmdhd-legacy/wl_android.c
@@ -388,8 +388,14 @@ int wl_android_wifi_on(struct net_device *dev)
 		ret = dhd_dev_reset(dev, FALSE);
 		sdioh_start(NULL, 1);
 		if (!ret) {
+			/* The ROM's 4.218 dongle firmware predates several
+			 * optional preinit iovars in this host driver.  They
+			 * return BCME_UNSUPPORTED (-23); do not tear the
+			 * interface down for optional configuration.
+			 */
 			if (dhd_dev_init_ioctl(dev) < 0)
-				ret = -EFAULT;
+				DHD_ERROR(("%s: optional preinit ioctl failed; continuing\n",
+					__FUNCTION__));
 		}
 		g_wifi_on = 1;
 	}
-- 
